@startuml
title Figure 4.11: Sequence Diagram of the Generate Unit Tests.
actor User
participant "Vue\n(Generate.vue)" as Vue
participant "Rust\n(generation.rs)" as Rust
participant "Pynguin" as Py
database "SQLite" as DB

Vue -> Rust: scan_source_files(projectPath)
Rust --> Vue: source file tree
Vue -> Rust: check_generation_env(interpreter)
Rust --> Vue: {pythonVersion, pynguinVersion}

alt BOM files detected
    Vue -> Rust: check_python_bom(files)
    Rust --> Vue: BOM file list
    User -> Vue: confirm fix
    Vue -> Rust: strip_python_bom(files)
end

User -> Vue: select modules + advanced settings
Vue -> Rust: generate_tests(projectId, path, interpreter, files, config)
loop for each module
    Rust -> Py: spawn pynguin (algorithm, time, seed, ...)
    Py --> Rust: stdout / stderr
    Rust --> Vue: events generation-progress / generation-output
    alt user cancels
        Vue -> Rust: cancel_run(runId)
    end
    alt generation succeeded
        Rust -> Py: rename_generated_tests.py
    end
    Rust -> Rust: count_test_cases per file
end
Rust --> Vue: event generation-finished {generatedFiles}
Rust -> DB: save generation_history + generation_file_details
@enduml
